  "historyNote": "#7496, eff 5-23-01; ss by #9476, eff 5-22-09; ss by #12178, INTERIM, eff 5-20-17, EXPIRED: 11-16-17 New. #12476, eff 2-16-18 (from He-A 304.17)",
